	(text "High power solenoid drivers (sol. 1-8): IPD90N10S4L-06 DPAK (100 V, 14 mOhm, 16 mOhm at 4.5 V) driven directly by latch U5 (74HCT574, output HIGH = ON,\noutputs tri-stated by BLANKING -> gate pull-downs hold every driver OFF). SMC 3 A tie-back diodes return to +50V (the \"+50V\" rail of a WPC\nmachine is ~70 V DC: 51 VAC winding, 72-78 V peak). U5 is clocked by /SOL 4 (J113-10). Output connectors J130 (playfield, key pin 3), J132 (backbox, sol 1-4, key 4)\nand J131 (cabinet, sol 5-8, key 2) as on the A-12697. Supply +50V via F105 on J107-3."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 15.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5376407f-6ca0-4f92-a9e8-fcef1b9d48be")
	)
